|What's the best way to get the Clairvoyance intrinsic?
|It was just stated a couple of days ago that you can get it by
|offering less than 400*exp-level to priests so that you get
|"a blessing" rather than better AC.
|Does anyone know what the minimum offering is to get intrinsics?

Clairvoyance is never intrinsic, but always expires.  If you give a
priest an amount of money that is between 200 and 400 times your level,
but not less than half of what you have, you will get from 500 to 1000 
turns more of it.  Personally, I'd go for the AC.
